  "title": "A specific generative model is a falsifiable theory",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "a520616a-6489-4d77-b958-d875cb86f385",
      "text": "The principle becomes testable when one commits to a specific generative model of a particular system. That commitment is a specific, falsifiable theory, and simulations under it can be compared with data.",
